fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstclock.html#gst_clock_is_system_monotonic","fragment":"\n\tgst_clock_is_system_monotonic\n\n\n\tGst.Clock.prototype.is_system_monotonic\n\n\n\tGst.Clock.is_system_monotonic\n\nChecks that clock is the default system clock, as returned by\ngst_system_clock_obtain, and is of type GST_CLOCK_TYPE_MONOTONIC.\nParameters:\na GstClock\nTRUE if clock is the default system monotonic clock,\nFALSE otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nChecks that clock is the default system clock, as returned by\nGst.SystemClock.prototype.obtain, and is of type Gst.ClockType.MONOTONIC.\nParameters:\na Gst.Clock\ntrue if clock is the default system monotonic clock,\nfalse otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nChecks that clock is the default system clock, as returned by\nGst.SystemClock.obtain, and is of type Gst.ClockType.MONOTONIC.\nParameters:\na Gst.Clock\nTrue if clock is the default system monotonic clock,\nFalse otherwise.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});